# Depth proof: two overlapping front faces. Face 0 is near (z=-4, DOS 12),
# face 1 is far (z=0, DOS 9). The engine must draw the far face first so the
# near one wins the shared pixels regardless of submission order.
canvas 64 64
camera 0 0 -8 0 0 0 0 1 0
project 90 1 1 1 100
light 0 0 1 256
mode solid cull
mesh quad 12 6
v -2 -2 -4
v 2 -2 -4
v 0 2 -4
v -2 -2 0
v 2 -2 0
v 0 2 0
c 0 12
c 1 9
f 0 1 2
f 3 4 5
end
draw quad
